{"3868370": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Awaken 8 : Fragments left behind", "steam_appid": 3868370, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3868370/extras/1f16bcabc8d76be339cb3ec1b27e4362.poster.avif?t=1784223240\" width=1474 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3868370/extras/1f16bcabc8d76be339cb3ec1b27e4362.webm?t=1784223240\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3868370/extras/1f16bcabc8d76be339cb3ec1b27e4362.mp4?t=1784223240\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3868370/extras/04bf0060975e9f1777e887ab0c19c53a.avif?t=1784223240\" width=782 height=138 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i><strong>Battle across two worlds, uncover lost memories, and awaken your true power to reclaim what was taken.</strong></i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Awaken 8 is a cinematic, emotionally-driven RPG set across two fractured worlds where forgotten memories hide dangerous truths  and rebellion begins behind a mask. In Virex City, emotion is treated like a threat and memories are quietly rewritten. Eight souls, scattered by time, loss, and broken pasts, cross paths once more. Some were once friends. Others, strangers. But all are bound by a history erased from the world and from themselves.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As their lives intertwine across reality and the emotional realm of Mythfall, they uncover fragments of who they used to be and what was taken from them. But awakening their truth comes with a cost in a world built on control.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beneath the neon skies of Virex City and the decaying magic of Mythfall, a masked rebellion quietly rises. The Awakened must face their shadows, reclaim what was stolen, and choose whether to remain lost…or rise together.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3868370/extras/b0acc445395759c364fb4cf2af8b6f43.avif?t=1784223240\" width=1216 height=768 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3868370/extras/541e0d1671286212b335f83a33df819b.avif?t=1784223240\" width=1344 height=698 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3868370/extras/96d6dc82f2d650da4fd160b260ef32d6.avif?t=1784223240\" width=900 height=514 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3868370/extras/38d3abe6a5274e65687a3aee2614501d.avif?t=1784223240\" width=900 height=514 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3868370/extras/43f96844afb800beb324da4507545748.avif?t=1784223240\" width=900 height=514 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3868370/extras/c1a42acdd6683e478144363ab20a56e5.avif?t=1784223240\" width=792 height=142 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3868370/extras/9140206164e66b59508e0aa76d4806b9.avif?t=1784223240\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3868370/extras_big/9140206164e66b59508e0aa76d4806b9.avif?t=1784223240 width=1560 height=560 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Virex city</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>A city that erased its own past.</strong><br>Under its glowing skyline and rigid control systems, Virex City is a society built on emotional suppression. Here, pain is illegal, memories are monitored, and “stability” is enforced by the masked elite. Behind every perfect smile is a history that was deleted. And those who remember… are hunted. This is where the rebellion begins.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3868370/extras/45dedebd3605f73d8475d857a60528c4.avif?t=1784223240\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3868370/extras_big/45dedebd3605f73d8475d857a60528c4.avif?t=1784223240 width=1560 height=814 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3868370/extras/5cdfbfd31402c9edc7ba3e9d4692901c.avif?t=1784223240\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3868370/extras_big/5cdfbfd31402c9edc7ba3e9d4692901c.avif?t=1784223240 width=1560 height=876 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Mythfall</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This realm was once alive with magic now it stands fractured, a place most have forgotten. The ruins rise into skies that never see dawn, and the rivers themselves carry echoes of memory. It’s a land where beauty and sorrow walk hand in hand. what was once paradise now feels like a graveyard of dreams. Here, every step uncovers a fragment of the past  and each memory has its price.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3868370/extras/fcddca4e80dc20d94f5873c948582aa8.avif?t=1784223240\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3868370/extras_big/fcddca4e80dc20d94f5873c948582aa8.avif?t=1784223240 width=1560 height=876 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3868370/extras/36df92f9c5ff5319e3a342767ee06161.avif?t=1784223240\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3868370/extras_big/36df92f9c5ff5319e3a342767ee06161.avif?t=1784223240 width=1560 height=876 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3868370/extras/d0d39f2d5b05a7f7d6c8c8fbd044d3f0.avif?t=1784223240\" width=1006 height=108 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3868370/extras/ad68dbacb17cf81e5664b3ef9524d1e6.avif?t=1784223240\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3868370/extras_big/ad68dbacb17cf81e5664b3ef9524d1e6.avif?t=1784223240 width=1560 height=556 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3868370/extras/fdbb213dc72ac3e915428af71362734a.avif?t=1784223240\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3868370/extras_big/fdbb213dc72ac3e915428af71362734a.avif?t=1784223240 width=1560 height=876 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3868370/extras/8dbb050cc061528c037462ae44bc9ab4.avif?t=1784223240\" width=980 height=564 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3868370/extras/4c18813aaa257e462ed8a731a51f659f.avif?t=1784223240\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3868370/extras_big/4c18813aaa257e462ed8a731a51f659f.avif?t=1784223240 width=1560 height=876 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3868370/extras/f209aa71201a98ff0d0f4f0a276ca278.avif?t=1784223240\" width=1282 height=724 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3868370/extras/20be45e9645ce3c39fdb365de9ed9b70.avif?t=1784223240\" width=1368 height=768 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3868370/extras/45e00132c4c9bd212ce3818b11ecbf4e.avif?t=1784223240\" width=1336 height=768 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>A Cast Beyond the Spotlight</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >While the story highlights  these certain figures whose choices shape the rebellion, <i>Virex City </i> and mythfall is alive with over 10 <strong>unique characters</strong>. Each brings their own motives, allegiances, and secrets. From allies in the underground to hidden rivals in the system, every encounter deepens the web of trust and betrayal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3868370/extras/6c7973489256d9138fb1925549483be5.avif?t=1784223240\" width=792 height=122 /></span