 ><u><strong>A Cast Beyond the Spotlight</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >While the story highlights  these certain figures whose choices shape the rebellion, <i>Virex City </i> and mythfall is alive with over 10 <strong>unique characters</strong>. Each brings their own motives, allegiances, and secrets. From allies in the underground to hidden rivals in the system, every encounter deepens the web of trust and betrayal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3868370/extras/6c7973489256d9138fb1925549483be5.avif?t=1784223240\" width=792 height=122 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3868370/extras/2850e27d7cae9a558b5c5061e170c890.avif?t=1784223240\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3868370/extras_big/2850e27d7cae9a558b5c5061e170c890.avif?t=1784223240 width=1560 height=496 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dual worlds: Cyberpunk Virex &amp; Fantasy Mythfall</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >10+ character cast with deep emotional arcs</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Original cinematic soundtrack including K-pop inspired tracks </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Masked rebellion system</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choices that carry emotional weight</p></li></ul>", "short_description": "Emotions are illegal. Memories are erased. But eight lost souls are starting to remember. Awaken 8 is a dark cinematic RPG where every feeling could save or destroy you. Two worlds. One truth. Your past is the key", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_